{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-zHV6-ouQGNt55lYkaCWg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:31.304239+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D-zHV6-ouQGNt55lYkaCWg","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><strong><span>国际汉语文化学院</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2025年优秀大学生夏令营</span></strong><strong><span>活动</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>招生公告</span></strong></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>国际汉语文化学院优秀大学生夏令营面向全国高等院校大学生，旨在帮助优秀大学生增加对中国语言文学（文艺学、汉语言文字学、中国现当代文学、中国古代文学、比较文学与世界文学、语言学及应用语言学）和国际中文教育学科、专业的前沿动态和发展前景的了解，增强科研兴趣，拓展研究视野，提高科学素养。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/paYYTx37yoDFHhm5rEQIFs7UXImAicrvAUUnT6cjia9UCribw86u2761Qibmdm4adHeQcn9WDCicYgxVnHm4btu5Oww/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>华东师范大学国际汉语文化学院拟于2025年7月2日-7月3日举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营，拟招收营员约140人（学术学位60人，专业学位80人）。热烈欢迎有志于在我校深造研究的青年学子们报名参加。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、报名条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>我院“优秀大学生夏令营”招生面向全国高等院校本科2022级（2026年6月毕业）有志攻读硕士研究生的优秀在校大学生。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名条件：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、学习成绩优秀，本科前三年学习成绩在所在专业年级总排名的前20%以内，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、有志于中国语言文学（文艺学、汉语言文字学、中国现当代文学、中国古代文学、比较文学与世界文学、语言学及应用语言学）和国际中文教育等学科、专业的学术研究，并具有较强的专业基础、学科背景、创新意识和研究能力（如：有高质量学术论文公开发表，丰富的科研项目经历，或者在全国重大竞赛中获奖等）；或有志于作为一名国际汉语教师在国内外从事国际汉语教学、推广中国文化等工作，并具有较强的专业能力（如：有相关实习、实践经历）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3、英语水平好，至少达到大学英语六级水平，具有较强的英语写作和口语表达能力。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/paYYTx37yoDFHhm5rEQIFs7UXImAicrvAMtrL5ic0Z9pcp5e0rQNx3PFRWNAJHMMA0qlO8MTsWeYLsMxQKkVaY2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、报名学科、专业</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>本次可申请的夏令营学科、专业包含：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1、</span><strong><span>学术学位</span></strong><span>：中国语言文学（文艺学、汉语言文字学、中国现当代文学、中国古代文学、比较文学与世界文学、语言学及应用语言学）。</span></p><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>专业学位</span></strong><span>：国际中文教育。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、报名程序及提交材料办法</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>申请参加我院“优秀大学生夏令营”的学生须在我校研究生报考服务系统进行网上报名。在系统中需填写个人信息，按照要求上传相关材料。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>投递方式：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1、</span><strong><span>报名网站</span></strong><span>：华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4）进行网上报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2、</span><strong><span>报名截止时间</span></strong><span>：2025年6月15日。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>所需材料：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>①居民身份证、夏令营诚信承诺书、《华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（具体要求见报名系统）；</span></p><p><span>②个人简历（介绍本人的外语能力、学习业绩、专业能力倾向、工作成果、学术研究兴趣、曾参与过的科研项目、创新意识创新能力、及其他本人认为对于申请有参考价值的内容）；</span></p><p><span>③个人简历中提及的相关证明材料（含本科成绩单、英语等级证书、论文发表、科研项目、各类获奖或资格证书等）；</span></p><p><span>④申请学术学位的学生需提交一份与申请专业相关的、关于某一语言或文学现象的研究报告或论文；</span></p><p><span>⑤申请专业学位的学生需提交一份与国际中文教育相关的教学设计方案或案例分析报告。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若在任何阶段发现申请材料不真实、不准确，或有弄虚作假、违纪作弊等行为的，即取消申请人一切资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、主要活动及日程安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2025年优秀大学生夏令营采用线下现场形式进行，拟定于7月2日上午报到，7月3日下午结营。</span></p><p><span>夏令营活动主要有学院及各学科（专业）介绍、讲座报告、专业技能交流和学习经验分享等，具体日程另行通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五、材料审核及录取</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、审核和录取工作由国际汉语文化学院组织专门委员会负责。录取约于6月下旬在华东师范大学考生服务系统网站上公布，并以电子邮件形式通知本人，届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span>2、收到入营录取通知的同学，请务必于24小时内在系统中确认并以邮件形式署名回复确认是否前来参加，逾期视为放弃资格。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>六、优秀营员评选</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>优秀营员的评选规则、效力认定等另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>七、支持资助</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、本次夏令营提供活动期间中、晚餐。</span></p><p><span>2、住宿及差旅自理。</span></p><p><span>3、自行购买夏令营保险。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z8ZAMa2oQtYssptfUAK6dol4ezCWjia1TFuZkOeHcACEX1u6T2A1ekpZlvDDoLtya4cibcibO5h9SKqEGUezwa2oA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>八、联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>学术学位研究生：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong><span>：文艺学、汉语言文字学、中国现当代文学、中国古代文学、比较文学与世界文学、语言学及应用语言学专业</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong><span>：陈老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-62233100 </span></p><p><span>邮箱：jychen@hanyu.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>专业学位研究生：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业</span></strong><span>：国际中文教育硕士</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系人：孙老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-62609784</span></p><p><span>邮箱：xxsun@chinese.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/paYYTx37yoDFHhm5rEQIFs7UXImAicrvAnt8v6Ex2UI7QwSTbeQDrVjIHiceHFXPClNoEEYZCjX23Z1uzm5xhzAA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>—END—</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>往期回顾：</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3MDU1MDk1OA==&amp;mid=2247511700&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7c884997a58b5b20941e3f185a4fafef&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">品味汉语魅力，共启文化新程——国际汉语文化学院研究生招生盛启</a></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>排版：许美静</span></p><p><span>审核：陈俊颖，丁安琪</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d5edac0cb655abb451e83ed5d99d24b2851e665399dee4b16cbd3f66b5fa715e","textLength":1829,"sourceSha256":"1a8ddcec3b7033aec3d44bb6a14ef4e892725638e4c4815c02defff4ca955c57","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dc9189c0c8c738d6216a","title":"2025年华东师范大学国际汉语文化学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营活动招生公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:31.304239+00:00"}
